### 7.5 **Plotting the spatio-temporal KDE object**

We use `plot()` to plot the KDE for between July 2023 - December 2023.




::: {.cell}

```{.r .cell-code}
par(bg = "#D0DDD0")
tims <- c(7, 8, 9, 10, 11, 12)
par(mfcol = c(2,3))
for (i in tims){
  plot(st_kde, i,
       override.par = FALSE,
       fix.range = TRUE)
  title(main = paste("Month", i))
}
```

::: {.cell-output-display}
![](Hands-on_Ex03_files/figure-html/unnamed-chunk-18-1.png){width=672}
:::
