### 9.1 **Computing spatio-temporal KDE**

Now the STKDE will be derived by using `h` and `lambda` values derived in previous step.




::: {.cell}

```{.r .cell-code}
kde_yday <- spattemp.density(fire_yday_owin,
                             h = 9105, lambda = 19)
summary(kde_yday)
