### 9.2 **Plotting the output spatio-temporal KDE**

Lastly, we use `plot()` of **sparr** package to plot the output. For simplicity, we will plot between day 199-298.




::: {.cell}

```{.r .cell-code}
par(bg = "#b2c2b3")
tims <- c(199:298)
par(mfcol = c(1,4))
for (i in tims){
  plot(kde_yday, i,
       override.par = FALSE,
       fix.range = TRUE)
  title(main = paste("Day", i))
}
```

